This is for instructors or automated evaluation. 
# Solution Guide 
## Root Cause 
A large file was intentionally created in: C:\DiskFill 
File: diskfill.dat 
## Investigation Steps
 ### Check Disk Usage 
powershell Get-CimInstance Win32_LogicalDisk | Select DeviceID, @{N="UsedPct";E={ :Round( (($_.Size-$_.FreeSpace)/$_.Size)*100,2) }}

Expected:
C: ≈ 95%

Identify Large Files
Get-ChildItem C:\DiskFill

Expected:
diskfill.dat
Remediation Option 1
Remove-Item C:\DiskFill\diskfill.dat

Remediation Option 2
Execute AWX Job Template:
JT-Disk-Cleanup

Validate
Get-CimInstance Win32_LogicalDisk
Expected:
Utilization < 85%

Expected Outcome
Before:
95%
After:
<85%



